  "summary": "Software engineer with over 25 years professional experience, including 14 years at Google.\n\nI'm a generalist, but particularly expert in Java and other JVM languages. I have extensive experience with asynchronous Java and optimizing performance.\n\nI have extensive API design experience. Most recently, I've paired these skills to build Google's internal GraphQL framework up from scratch to a point where it powers the Google Cloud Console.\n\nPrevious experience has included a wide variety of database systems - SQL, NoSQL, Memcache, and even designing custom systems for unique needs. (An in-memory database I designed powers Google's DoubleClick Campaign Manager.)\n\nAlways happy to chat more about my work and interests. Feel free to reach out.",
